--- stderr
line 1 (roof): roof 100002: courtyard 0 isn't inside its outline

$ bimcraft-cli run --cmd 'wall {"points": [[0,0],[6000,0],[6000,4000],[0,4000]], "closed": true, "type": "Exterior - 300mm"}
roof {"level": "Level 1"}'
